  #line-at(277.562pt, 316.677pt, "Abstract")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#231f20"))
  #line-at(95.28pt, 332.28pt, "Programmable microheater arrays are essential for a variety of applications including gas sensing, mi-")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 343.08pt, "crofluidic lab on a chip devices, 3D printers, and biosensors that rely on DNA amplification. Increasing the ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 354pt, "density and number of heating elements directly correlates with the precision with which spatiotemporal ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 364.8pt, "heat profiles can be delivered. However, large arrays have thus far not been realized. One challenge is that ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 375.6pt, "as the number of elements in an array increases, the complexity of connecting them grows. Here, we show ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 386.4pt, "that row-column addressing provides a promising architecture for the efficient operation of a large micro-")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 398.04pt, "heater array. We introduce a programmable 32 ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#231f20"))
  #line-at(268.8pt, 398.04pt, "× ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 9pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#231f20"))
  #line-at(278.76pt, 398.04pt, "32 microheater array consisting of individually addressable ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 409.32pt, "robust platinum (Pt)-based Joule heating elements – each smaller than 300 ")
  #line-at(392.64pt, 409.32pt, "μ")
  #line-at(397.56pt, 409.32pt, "m. We show that combining ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 420.48pt, "high-voltage multiplexed electronics and sequential addressing controlled by a high frequency clock, allows ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 431.4pt, "the independent operation of the 1024 microheater elements. We demonstrate the generation of heat images ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 442.2pt, "and the patterning of metallic structures formed from the liquid metal Gallium. Our work demonstrates ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 453pt, "new capabilities for on-chip thermal devices, and opens the possibility to realize novel heat-controlled micro ")
  #line-at(81.48pt, 463.8pt, "actuation systems.")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 15.16pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#231f20"))
